---
version: "0.2.0"
meta:
  title: Staircase continuations
  note: >
    The + marker lives at the end of the raw field (outside any wrapper).
    It applies to whole cells only. A bare + line is an empty segment
    (blank line inside the cell). See SPEC §13.
---
id|description :text:|payload
1|+|+
First line of a long description+|+
"second line with a | pipe"|{"note": "multi-line JSON is fine"}
2|+|+
paragraph text|+
with a blank line|+
+|done
and more
3|"quoted continuation"+|+
"still continued"|done
